1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:30,000
= kisskh.asia =

2
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:47,480
It's this late. What are we doing here?

3
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:50,120
Showing you something.

4
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,799
They have shows here at night?

5
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:54,400
Come on. You'll see in a minute.

6
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:59,960
Ruan, what are you looking at?

7
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:03,200
Thought I saw someone I knew.

8
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:08,040
Don't worry. Xuan can handle it.

9
00:02:08,040 --> 00:02:11,520
Now, please put away your tray table,

10
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:15,360
return your seatback to the upright position,
and prepare for takeoff!

11
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:22,960
[Episode 4]
[A Big Liar Indeed!]

12
00:02:34,470 --> 00:02:36,920
Ruan Si Xian?

13
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:39,880
- Jiang.
- It is you!

14
00:02:41,943 --> 00:02:45,720
What a coincidence, running into you here.

15
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:48,240
How have you been?

16
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:50,440
Pretty good.

17
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:53,800
- Off today?
- I'm on domestic routes now.

18
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:57,200
Just two legs local, much easier.

19
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:59,759
It's been three years, hasn't it?

20
00:02:59,759 --> 00:03:03,120
I was talking about you
with some old colleagues.

21
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:05,200
About me?

22
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:07,080
What's there to talk about?

23
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:09,600
It's such a shame, you know?

24
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:14,560
You were so smart and pretty,
and Wang Le Kang had a thing for you back then.

25
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:19,920
If you hadn't quit on impulse,
you'd be a purser by now,

26
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:23,560
or maybe even management.

27
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:27,880
But seeing you so carefree now,
I'm really happy for you.

28
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:29,320
You know how it is.

29
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:32,360
Flight attendants look glamorous,

30
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:35,960
but it's actually exhausting,
all those odd hours.

31
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:37,720
Ruan.

32
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:39,000
Coming!

33
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:43,080
Jiang, I've got work to do.

34
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:48,080
Ruan, we should get together sometime.

35
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:50,000
Plenty of time for that.

36
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:03,800
What took you so long?

37
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:05,320
Guess who I just ran into?

38
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:06,840
Who?

39
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:10,079
A colleague?

40
00:04:10,079 --> 00:04:11,200
Forget it.

41
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:13,200
You wouldn't remember her anyway.

42
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:17,760
By the way, I've never been to
Mingchen Mansion.

43
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:22,080
I heard the captains' quarters
are way better now.

44
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:24,960
Yes, the place is much nicer now.

45
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:28,920
Well, but we can't go there these days.

46
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,240
It's a bit messy.

47
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:34,760
I'll come over today and help you clean up.

48
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:38,520
Come on, that's not the plan today.

49
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:40,240
And I'd never make you do that.

50
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:42,520
I've got a cleaner coming.

51
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:44,040
I booked a table.

52
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,920
Let's go somewhere else.

53
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,080
Never mind.

54
00:04:48,756 --> 00:04:51,720
Just remembered I'm on standby in two days.

55
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,800
I'll head back.

56
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,920
That's a pity.

57
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:58,840
I was hoping we'd celebrate together.

58
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:03,560
Celebrate what?

59
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:06,920
The Z101's first flight.

60
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:12,520
Jiang Zi Yue will be the purser
for that inaugural flight.

61
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:15,160
Don't you think that's worth celebrating?

62
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,879
The crew list is confirmed?

63
00:05:16,879 --> 00:05:18,440
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

64
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:20,800
I wanted it to be a surprise.

65
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:22,720
But looks like you're not giving me a chance.

66
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:25,040
Are you sure it's a surprise?

67
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:30,043
You'll see when you get there.

68
00:05:30,043 --> 00:05:32,006
- Come on.
- Don't lie to me.

69
00:05:32,006 --> 00:05:33,806
I wouldn't.

70
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,360
Let's go.

71
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,825
Gone?

72
00:05:51,825 --> 00:05:54,706
I didn't see anyone come down.

73
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:57,800
Who didn't come down?

74
00:06:06,696 --> 00:06:08,040
Mr. Fu?

75
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:12,240
You're kind of terrifying
in the middle of the night.

76
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:14,120
Quite cold.

77
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:18,080
How much got on there?
Could you wipe it off for me?

78
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:51,800
Looks like I spread it around instead.

79
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:01,560
Aren't you on your period?

80
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:03,880
Why are you still eating ice cream?

81
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:06,000
No more cold food from now on.

82
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:12,560
Eat the congee while it's warm.

83
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:15,823
There's a hand warmer inside,
and some painkillers too.

84
00:07:15,823 --> 00:07:21,640
Mr. Fu, why the sudden kindness?

85
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:24,080
Looking after my employee.

86
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:28,760
Even so, I'm still requesting changes
to the publicity plan.

87
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:30,586
Fine.

88
00:07:30,586 --> 00:07:32,546
I won't force you.

89
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:48,279
It's not that I'm not cooperating.

90
00:07:48,279 --> 00:07:50,880
You were hiding things.

91
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:58,293
I'm not forcing you,
and not just because I owe you one.

92
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:06,440
Owe me one?

93
00:08:07,213 --> 00:08:08,933
Today?

94
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:14,000
He couldn't have remembered, could he?

95
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:18,640
Hengshi Air 5101, Runway 04, cleared to land.

96
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:21,800
Wind 330 at 5 meters per second.

97
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:25,160
Runway 04, cleared to land, Hengshi Air 5101.

98
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:26,360
Landing clearance confirmed.

99
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:28,320
Crosswind left 10 knots.

100
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,760
Check.

101
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:31,840
Landing checklist.

102
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:34,881
Landing checklist.

103
00:09:34,881 --> 00:09:36,720
ECAM. Memo.

104
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,000
Landing, no blue.

105
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:40,000
- Cabin.
- Ready.

106
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:41,960
Landing checklist complete.

107
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:43,720
100,

108
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,520
50,

109
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,640
40,

110
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:51,680
- 30,
- Hold it.

111
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,519
- 20...
- Good.

112
00:09:53,519 --> 00:09:55,399
Pull back a bit more.

113
00:09:55,399 --> 00:09:57,920
Good.

114
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:12,720
Jiang, I almost forgot.

115
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:15,640
The other morning
I ran into the new female pilot.

116
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:16,760
Really?

117
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:18,110
What does she look like?

118
00:10:18,110 --> 00:10:19,960
Forget her looks for a second.

119
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:22,120
She said her name is Ruan Si Xian.

120
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:24,390
No way. You must've misheard.

121
00:10:24,390 --> 00:10:25,600
I don't think so.

122
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:28,640
I was face-to-face with her,
and she definitely said Ruan Si Xian.

123
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:30,960
Absolutely impossible.

124
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:34,530
If you don't believe me,
come with me somewhere tonight.

125
00:10:34,530 --> 00:10:38,240
Right now, she's just a little waitress.

126
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:51,360
Thanks for your time, Fan.

127
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:53,480
You deserve that, top of your class.

128
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:56,320
If it were anyone else, I'd take it.

129
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,519
But you?

130
00:10:57,519 --> 00:11:00,156
You taught me everything I know.

131
00:11:00,156 --> 00:11:02,799
The inaugural flight is coming up.
Keep practicing.

132
00:11:02,799 --> 00:11:05,120
- I hope to see you in the captain's seat.
- Got it.

133
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:08,080
We'll go over more in the briefing room.

134
00:11:14,256 --> 00:11:18,800
Ms. Ruan, would you do me the honor of
joining me for dinner tonight?

135
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:22,960
Ruan, Mr. Fu would like to
invite you to dinner tonight.

136
00:11:25,453 --> 00:11:28,373
Sounds good, Mr. Yan. See you tonight.

137
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:33,760
Sorry, Mr. Bai. I have plans tonight.

138
00:11:51,258 --> 00:11:54,260
Either come in or get out. Just say it.

139
00:11:54,260 --> 00:11:55,720
Mr. Fu, it's like this.

140
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:59,400
Ms. Ruan said she had plans tonight.

141
00:11:59,400 --> 00:12:01,360
Then make it tomorrow.

142
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:05,919
Well, what if she's booked tomorrow too?

143
00:12:05,919 --> 00:12:11,919
- What do you mean?
- Do we have a plan B for the publicity?

144
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:22,200
[New Friends]

145
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:31,560
Send me Ruan Si Xian's WeChat contact.

146
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,640
Sorry, but what?

147
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:35,840
Ruan Si Xian. Her WeChat.

148
00:12:38,520 --> 00:12:40,880
Got it. I'm on it.

149
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:47,680
Mr. Fu. I'm done.

150
00:12:48,520 --> 00:12:50,360
I have eyes.

151
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:13,200
Isn't that Yan An?

152
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:15,760
What brings him here today?

153
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:18,399
Is that the female pilot he's chasing?

154
00:13:18,399 --> 00:13:20,440
He talked about it at the party last time.

155
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:24,000
I have to say, they look like a good match.

156
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:42,398
Mr. Yan, your bill's been paid.

157
00:13:42,398 --> 00:13:43,800
Paid already?

158
00:13:43,800 --> 00:13:44,880
By whom?

159
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:46,800
The lady over there.

160
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:51,080
Ms. Ruan.

161
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:55,280
I've never let anyone pay for me my whole life.

162
00:13:55,280 --> 00:13:57,320
You can't be the one to break that streak.

163
00:13:57,320 --> 00:14:00,800
Otherwise, my reputation's shot.

164
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:04,360
Mr. Yan, you do know how to pick friends.

165
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:07,320
They make you pay every time.
Aren't they ashamed?

166
00:14:08,067 --> 00:14:10,240
So polite and considerate.

167
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:15,440
Fine. Then let me ask you, Ms. Ruan,
when exactly did you pay the bill?

168
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:18,880
The time you went to the restroom,
or earlier, the time you took that call?

169
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:23,280
This meal is to thank you for the
appreciation you showed me at the academy.

170
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:26,080
And yet you never showed up at Bo'ao Air.

171
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:28,920
Fu Ming Yu's the lucky one.

172
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:38,720
But I'll tell you this. That man is dangerous.

173
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:42,320
You'd better stay far away from him.

174
00:14:42,320 --> 00:14:44,560
Then this meal is even more on me.

175
00:14:44,560 --> 00:14:50,480
More precisely, it's on Fu Ming Yu,
because my salary comes out of his pocket.

176
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:52,760
Does that make you feel any better?

177
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:55,480
Now that doesn't sound half bad.

178
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:57,519
So what do you say?

179
00:14:57,519 --> 00:14:59,680
Find another place, grab a drink?

180
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:02,360
I've got training tomorrow. Can't drink.

181
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:04,400
- Then let me drive you home?
- Really, no need.

182
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:06,400
I've got plans with a friend tonight.

183
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:09,120
Let's do it another time.

184
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:12,960
Fine then.
I'll be waiting for your next invitation.

185
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:24,480
Am I late?

186
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:25,720
Enjoy your meal.

187
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:28,080
No, take your time. Slow night anyway.

188
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:29,560
I was about to close up early.

189
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:33,680
But Xiao Zhen seemed like
she had something to tell you.

190
00:15:37,280 --> 00:15:38,760
Two things.

191
00:15:38,760 --> 00:15:41,320
First, I've got an early shift tomorrow.

192
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:46,200
Can I crash at "Captain" Ruan's fancy house
for the night?

193
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:51,360
- No problem.
- I knew you were the best!

194
00:15:53,040 --> 00:15:57,560
And second, to thank you, ta-da!

195
00:15:57,560 --> 00:15:59,240
My parents got me a new car.

196
00:15:59,240 --> 00:16:01,200
Tonight, I'm driving "Captain" Ruan home!

197
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:02,960
- Let's go.
- Wait!

198
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:08,520
Maybe we should just take a cab.

199
00:16:08,520 --> 00:16:11,480
I can't fly a plane, but I can drive, alright?

200
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:14,000
Don't worry, I passed
both Subject Two and Three on the first try.

201
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,320
Come with me.

202
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:17,000
"Captain" Ruan, good luck.

203
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:18,240
Don't worry.

204
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:20,120
Come on, get in.

205
00:16:28,560 --> 00:16:32,684
It's this late. What are we doing here?

206
00:16:32,684 --> 00:16:35,200
Showing you something.

207
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:37,280
They have shows here at night?

208
00:16:37,280 --> 00:16:39,920
Come on. You'll see in a minute.

209
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:44,360
Now, please put away your tray table,

210
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:49,720
return your seatback to the upright position,
and prepare for takeoff!

211
00:17:38,160 --> 00:17:39,440
What was that sound?

212
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:40,880
Don't scare me.

213
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:42,680
I just got this car.

214
00:17:42,680 --> 00:17:44,520
Get out and check?

215
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:46,520
I dare not.

216
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:26,080
[Rolls-Royce Dawn]

217
00:18:32,560 --> 00:18:35,120
I have good news and bad news.

218
00:18:35,120 --> 00:18:36,440
Hit me.

219
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:40,280
The good news is, your car is undamaged.

220
00:18:40,280 --> 00:18:42,519
Really?

221
00:18:42,519 --> 00:18:46,920
The bad news is, you hit that one.

222
00:18:53,019 --> 00:18:55,100
What car is this?

223
00:18:56,040 --> 00:18:59,359
Ruan, is it too late to run?

224
00:18:59,359 --> 00:19:00,520
You could.

225
00:19:00,520 --> 00:19:02,640
But if money can fix it, why go to jail?

226
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:06,600
But right now, I can't afford
anything that can be fixed with money.

227
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:10,360
Why not call your insurance?

228
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:17,320
Hello, Mr. Yan.

229
00:19:17,320 --> 00:19:19,400
Ms. Ruan, are you home yet?

230
00:19:21,120 --> 00:19:24,216
Actually, I have something to ask you.

231
00:19:24,216 --> 00:19:25,880
Go ahead.

232
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:32,080
There's a black convertible
with license plate four ones.

233
00:19:32,080 --> 00:19:33,400
Whose is it?

234
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:36,240
Fu Ming Yu's black Rolls-Royce?

235
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:40,200
That car was my dream ride.

236
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:43,400
He snatched it right from under me.
Still pisses me off.

237
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:45,680
Okay, I see.

238
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:48,840
I've got something to deal with. Got to go.

239
00:19:55,050 --> 00:19:56,283
You're done for.

240
00:19:56,283 --> 00:19:58,319
It's Fu Ming Yu's car.

241
00:19:58,319 --> 00:20:00,520
Mr. Fu's car?

242
00:20:02,746 --> 00:20:06,280
Then maybe there's still hope?

243
00:20:06,280 --> 00:20:09,680
Hope? You'd better pray for yourself.

244
00:20:10,840 --> 00:20:13,560
Of all the cars you could hit...

245
00:20:16,320 --> 00:20:22,320
[New Friends: Accept Friend Request]

246
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:27,840
[Fu Ming Yu]

247
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:34,160
What should I do?

248
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:36,360
Here's the drink menu.

249
00:20:37,640 --> 00:20:40,800
Hey, handsome, can I ask you something?

250
00:20:40,800 --> 00:20:41,960
Sure.

251
00:20:41,960 --> 00:20:46,200
Do you have a waitress here named Ruan Si Xian?

252
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:50,920
Yes. Why?

253
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:53,520
Nothing, just wondering.

254
00:20:53,520 --> 00:20:55,139
I'll have sparkling water.

255
00:20:55,139 --> 00:20:57,160
- Got it.
- Same for me.

256
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:59,120
Coming right up.

257
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:02,000
Told you.

258
00:21:41,880 --> 00:21:43,600
Who hit it?

259
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:47,200
I did.

260
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:50,000
Mr. Fu, I didn't mean to.

261
00:21:50,727 --> 00:21:53,360
I'll pay for it, I promise.

262
00:21:53,360 --> 00:21:55,240
No need. Did you call your insurance?

263
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:58,360
Not yet.

264
00:21:58,360 --> 00:22:00,480
Really, you don't want me to pay?

265
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:05,480
Ruan Si Xian's salary can cover it just fine.

266
00:22:11,880 --> 00:22:14,040
Don't worry about it.
I'll file it on my insurance.

267
00:22:14,040 --> 00:22:15,119
If that's all, I'll head out.

268
00:22:15,119 --> 00:22:17,079
That's it?

269
00:22:17,079 --> 00:22:18,840
Mr. Fu, take care!

270
00:22:19,560 --> 00:22:21,800
He said we don't have to worry. Let's go.

271
00:22:21,800 --> 00:22:23,820
Go where? It's not settled yet.

272
00:22:23,820 --> 00:22:25,960
You want to leave? Wait here.

273
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:28,480
Fine.

274
00:22:31,400 --> 00:22:33,200
Still laughing?

275
00:22:34,080 --> 00:22:36,960
Never noticed he's pretty nice.

276
00:22:36,960 --> 00:22:38,200
So polite and gentle.

277
00:22:38,200 --> 00:22:40,960
Took it well and didn't even get mad.

278
00:22:43,280 --> 00:22:45,360
Wait, something doesn't feel right.

279
00:22:45,360 --> 00:22:48,520
He doesn't seem like that type.

280
00:22:49,280 --> 00:22:50,720
He won't fire me, will he?

281
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:53,800
No, I'm doomed.

282
00:22:57,440 --> 00:22:59,360
Looks like the insurance folks are here.

283
00:22:59,360 --> 00:23:02,240
You better go down and check.

284
00:23:10,040 --> 00:23:11,640
Let's get on. Mr. Fu.

285
00:23:11,640 --> 00:23:13,480
Registration and driver's license?

286
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:15,640
- Here, both are here.
- It's not that bad.

287
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:19,320
See for yourselves. Mainly the front
side here, and the rear side on hers.

288
00:23:19,320 --> 00:23:21,760
Hang on, let me get her information down.
Hold on.

289
00:23:21,760 --> 00:23:23,760
Here you go.

290
00:23:32,400 --> 00:23:35,040
Why are you back?

291
00:23:35,040 --> 00:23:37,040
To move the car.

292
00:23:37,040 --> 00:23:39,080
Your friend didn't dare.

293
00:24:02,160 --> 00:24:03,680
Hold on.

294
00:24:05,800 --> 00:24:09,400
Is the seatbelt necessary now?

295
00:24:09,400 --> 00:24:12,640
A pilot who doesn't buckle up?

296
00:24:14,559 --> 00:24:17,200
That beeping was driving me crazy.

297
00:24:28,880 --> 00:24:30,680
When I went upstairs just now,

298
00:24:30,680 --> 00:24:35,040
I reconsidered the damage on my way back up.

299
00:24:35,040 --> 00:24:37,240
Can't just let it slide.

300
00:24:38,760 --> 00:24:40,360
Mr. Fu, what do you mean?

301
00:24:40,360 --> 00:24:43,720
A big boss who eats his words in five minutes?

302
00:24:43,720 --> 00:24:45,360
Unless...

303
00:24:47,319 --> 00:24:48,480
Unless what?

304
00:24:48,480 --> 00:24:52,520
Unless you're willing to reconsider the shoot.

305
00:24:52,520 --> 00:24:55,640
I've given you my answer, Mr. Fu.

306
00:24:56,920 --> 00:24:58,880
I remember.

307
00:24:58,880 --> 00:25:00,880
And I hear you.

308
00:25:02,800 --> 00:25:04,800
Regarding the previous shoot,

309
00:25:04,800 --> 00:25:07,360
I didn't give enough respect to you

310
00:25:07,360 --> 00:25:11,920
and the publicity campaign
for the domestic aircraft.

311
00:25:11,920 --> 00:25:15,840
I'll have the Corporate Publicity Department
rework the entire plan.

312
00:25:16,573 --> 00:25:23,079
But I'd like you to be part of it as a witness,
and as someone indispensable.

313
00:25:23,079 --> 00:25:25,920
So you chose this moment to bring this up?

314
00:25:25,920 --> 00:25:29,440
You're not using the damages as leverage,
are you?

315
00:25:30,287 --> 00:25:35,720
Seems like this is the only chance
we get to sit down and talk.

316
00:25:35,720 --> 00:25:41,240
About the shoot, I accept your opinions,
and we'll go with what you're comfortable with.

317
00:25:41,240 --> 00:25:46,440
I know it's my duty here
to cooperate with the shoot,

318
00:25:46,440 --> 00:25:49,279
but I'd like to see the plan first.

319
00:25:49,279 --> 00:25:52,680
The publicity plan's still under wraps for now.

320
00:25:52,680 --> 00:25:57,680
But I can assure you,
you won't be doing it alone this time.

321
00:25:58,320 --> 00:26:00,175
No rush on your answer.

322
00:26:00,175 --> 00:26:02,280
I need some time to think things through too.

323
00:26:02,280 --> 00:26:04,560
Think it over.

324
00:26:04,560 --> 00:26:08,480
A lot of things I haven't figured out yet.

325
00:26:14,120 --> 00:26:18,080
But we've got each other's WeChat now.

326
00:26:18,080 --> 00:26:20,320
Take all the time you need.

327
00:26:25,560 --> 00:26:29,640
Since when am I taking my time with you?

328
00:26:33,080 --> 00:26:36,400
♪ I love taking baths, my skin is so nice ♪

329
00:26:38,040 --> 00:26:39,920
♪ So many bubbles... ♪

330
00:26:39,920 --> 00:26:41,520
Seriously, who invented this stuff?

331
00:26:41,520 --> 00:26:43,960
When I was a kid,
I thought the cartoons were exaggerated.

332
00:26:43,960 --> 00:26:46,200
Never thought it'd actually foam up this much.

333
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:48,960
Then tell me, who invented you?

334
00:26:48,960 --> 00:26:53,320
A minute ago you were shaking like a leaf,
and now you're acting like nothing happened.

335
00:26:53,320 --> 00:26:57,280
- You weren't faking it earlier, were you?
- What are you talking about?

336
00:26:57,280 --> 00:26:59,040
I was a little nervous, okay?

337
00:26:59,040 --> 00:27:00,240
Now's perfect.

338
00:27:00,240 --> 00:27:03,240
A bath calms my nerves
and washes away the bad luck.

339
00:27:03,240 --> 00:27:05,360
Besides, nothing really happened anyway.

340
00:27:05,360 --> 00:27:09,200
Remember, it's never really peace on its own.

341
00:27:09,200 --> 00:27:13,469
Someone else is bearing the weight for you.

342
00:27:13,469 --> 00:27:14,760
What do you mean?

343
00:27:14,760 --> 00:27:16,600
He's not making you pay, is he?

344
00:27:16,600 --> 00:27:18,120
No, not that.

345
00:27:18,120 --> 00:27:22,480
Then what took you two so long in the car?

346
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:25,680
He wants me to go ahead
with the publicity shoot.

347
00:27:25,680 --> 00:27:29,799
Ruan, if you don't want to do it, then don't.

348
00:27:29,799 --> 00:27:32,799
Worst case, I pay him back.

349
00:27:32,799 --> 00:27:34,920
If it comes to that, I'll sell my car.

350
00:27:34,920 --> 00:27:37,720
I only bought it to save on cabs anyway.

351
00:27:37,720 --> 00:27:40,600
Turns out driving costs even more.

352
00:27:40,600 --> 00:27:43,720
Just don't let him hold this over you.

353
00:27:43,720 --> 00:27:46,320
He didn't threaten me with it.

354
00:27:46,320 --> 00:27:47,599
He didn't?

355
00:27:47,599 --> 00:27:50,360
That's what's messing with my head.

356
00:27:50,360 --> 00:27:53,119
When things feel too off,
there's usually something behind it.

357
00:27:53,119 --> 00:27:57,039
Fu Ming Yu's been way too out of character
these days.

358
00:27:57,039 --> 00:28:00,320
Perhaps he's just a decent guy?

359
00:28:00,320 --> 00:28:02,480
And everything before was a misunderstanding?

360
00:28:02,480 --> 00:28:04,080
Assuming I wanted to be his wife?

361
00:28:04,080 --> 00:28:06,320
Baiting me with perks
to shoot an advertisement?

362
00:28:06,320 --> 00:28:07,720
Did I wrong him?

363
00:28:07,720 --> 00:28:12,160
I'm just saying, you have to
look at things with a dialectical perspective.

364
00:28:12,160 --> 00:28:14,880
- Take tonight, for example.
- Go on.

365
00:28:14,880 --> 00:28:18,480
I'd love to hear
how you're being so "dialectical" tonight.

366
00:28:18,480 --> 00:28:23,760
Let's see how you're sitting
in my bathtub taking his side.

367
00:28:23,760 --> 00:28:25,280
With that attitude?

368
00:28:25,280 --> 00:28:28,440
Do I look like someone
who cares about your pocket change?

369
00:28:28,440 --> 00:28:30,480
I'm done talking to you.

370
00:28:45,240 --> 00:28:47,640
Tomorrow morning, still at the hangar.

371
00:28:47,640 --> 00:28:50,040
Captain Fan will be there for the shoot.

372
00:28:50,040 --> 00:28:55,200
You don't have to join,
but I hope you can come and see.

373
00:29:01,093 --> 00:29:04,893
Mr. Bai, you're not selling me out, are you?

374
00:29:07,090 --> 00:29:09,120
Of course not.

375
00:29:09,120 --> 00:29:12,160
So he finally remembered who I am?

376
00:29:13,119 --> 00:29:16,120
Can't share the boss's secrets.

377
00:29:35,720 --> 00:29:37,640
Good morning, Ms. Zheng.

378
00:29:38,240 --> 00:29:42,160
What is this all about, bright and early?

379
00:29:42,160 --> 00:29:43,800
Where's Fu Ming Yu?

380
00:29:43,800 --> 00:29:45,480
In the car?

381
00:29:47,383 --> 00:29:50,600
Mr. Fu himself? What an honor.

382
00:29:50,600 --> 00:29:51,840
Why don't you head on back?

383
00:29:51,840 --> 00:29:54,400
I only came home to visit family anyway.

384
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:56,920
I'll have that down payment wired back to you.

385
00:29:56,920 --> 00:30:00,560
And let's call this partnership done.

386
00:30:00,560 --> 00:30:02,000
Still mad, Ms. Zheng?

387
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:03,200
You tell me.

388
00:30:03,200 --> 00:30:04,920
What kind of stunt is this, really?

389
00:30:04,920 --> 00:30:06,079
First you canceled on me.

390
00:30:06,079 --> 00:30:07,759
Then you show up at my home at dawn
to drag me out.

391
00:30:07,759 --> 00:30:09,560
What if I had other plans today?

392
00:30:09,560 --> 00:30:12,359
Are you folks just flying
by the seat of your pants every morning

393
00:30:12,359 --> 00:30:14,519
when it comes to routes?

394
00:30:14,519 --> 00:30:17,880
Yes, you are absolutely right.

395
00:30:17,880 --> 00:30:19,560
- Bai Yang.
- Yes?

396
00:30:19,560 --> 00:30:22,116
Are you just going to
leave Ms. Zheng standing there?

397
00:30:22,116 --> 00:30:25,240
Ms. Zheng, why not get in the car
and scold us from there?

398
00:30:27,359 --> 00:30:28,759
How can you guys be like this?

399
00:30:28,759 --> 00:30:31,561
Even a traveling circus
would set a schedule before they show up!

400
00:30:31,561 --> 00:30:32,839
Yes, you are right.

401
00:30:32,839 --> 00:30:36,080
But the inaugural flight is coming up.

402
00:30:36,080 --> 00:30:37,920
We really need your expertise.

403
00:30:37,920 --> 00:30:41,000
And what exactly does your inaugural flight
have to do with me?

404
00:30:41,000 --> 00:30:42,960
Hey, why is the car driving away?

405
00:30:42,960 --> 00:30:44,880
I'm sorry, but we're on a tight schedule.

406
00:30:44,880 --> 00:30:47,760
- We truly appreciate your help.
- I didn't even bring my camera!

407
00:30:47,760 --> 00:30:49,440
Already prepared.

408
00:30:55,400 --> 00:30:56,880
- Don't touch me.
- But...

409
00:30:56,880 --> 00:30:59,560
Who's our girl yelling at this early
in the morning?

410
00:30:59,560 --> 00:31:02,360
Probably Ming Yu.

411
00:31:02,360 --> 00:31:04,440
Ming Yu?

412
00:31:07,719 --> 00:31:11,480
Good.

413
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:16,120
Young people should stay in touch
and spend time together.

414
00:31:16,120 --> 00:31:17,800
Very good.

415
00:31:20,519 --> 00:31:24,280
Looks like a great work of art
is about to be born.

416
00:31:24,280 --> 00:31:26,000
Don't bother me.

417
00:31:26,000 --> 00:31:27,880
Go do your own thing.

418
00:31:29,080 --> 00:31:31,720
Okay.

419
00:31:36,560 --> 00:31:39,000
Move the ladder over there.

420
00:31:49,120 --> 00:31:52,920
Mr. Fu, she's not here yet.

421
00:31:54,440 --> 00:31:57,320
It's okay. We'll wait.

422
00:32:12,920 --> 00:32:14,840
Ruan is here.

423
00:32:14,840 --> 00:32:16,279
Ruan, you're here.

424
00:32:16,279 --> 00:32:18,880
Mr. Fu's been waiting for a while.

425
00:32:19,760 --> 00:32:22,200
Glad you could come.

426
00:32:58,560 --> 00:33:01,880
How are you feeling? Still not feeling well?

427
00:33:03,440 --> 00:33:06,800
So we're mostly shooting Captain Fan today?

428
00:33:06,800 --> 00:33:09,080
You could join too.

429
00:33:09,080 --> 00:33:13,720
However, there's someone else as well.

430
00:33:23,480 --> 00:33:24,840
Captain Huang Ying!

431
00:33:24,840 --> 00:33:25,960
Instructor Huang.

432
00:33:25,960 --> 00:33:28,200
- Hello.
- Thank you for coming.

433
00:33:28,200 --> 00:33:29,680
Busy these days?

434
00:33:29,680 --> 00:33:31,840
She's one of our first female pilots.

435
00:33:31,840 --> 00:33:35,400
Mr. Fu went to great lengths
to bring you all together for this campaign.

436
00:33:35,400 --> 00:33:37,720
Instructor Huang.

437
00:33:37,720 --> 00:33:39,680
Hello.

438
00:33:39,680 --> 00:33:43,600
I'm glad that I'm still able to
do my part for Hengshi Air.

439
00:33:43,600 --> 00:33:45,240
Thank you.

440
00:33:46,040 --> 00:33:47,680
Let me introduce you.

441
00:33:47,680 --> 00:33:51,280
This is one of our latest recruits,
Ruan Si Xian.

442
00:33:51,280 --> 00:33:54,080
She's now training under Captain Fan Lei.

443
00:33:57,360 --> 00:33:59,000
Hello.

444
00:33:59,760 --> 00:34:02,559
- Hello.
- Being a pilot is even tougher for us.

445
00:34:02,559 --> 00:34:04,200
Keep it up.

446
00:34:05,280 --> 00:34:06,960
Let's get ready for makeup.

447
00:34:06,960 --> 00:34:09,000
Okay. See you later.

448
00:34:09,000 --> 00:34:10,760
- I'll leave you to it.
- This way, please.

449
00:34:17,200 --> 00:34:19,440
Have you thought it over?

450
00:34:19,440 --> 00:34:22,720
Want to be part of the shoot?

451
00:34:28,360 --> 00:34:32,840
Mr. Fu, are you a mind reader?

452
00:34:32,840 --> 00:34:35,520
How do you always know what I want?

453
00:34:45,639 --> 00:34:47,280
Yeah, tomorrow morning at 9 a.m.

454
00:34:47,280 --> 00:34:50,800
A meeting at the office. Set it up.

455
00:34:51,720 --> 00:34:56,440
They call that kind of person a kindred spirit.

456
00:34:57,156 --> 00:35:01,840
Maybe for others, but not for you.

457
00:35:02,800 --> 00:35:04,808
Don't be so sure.

458
00:35:04,808 --> 00:35:07,599
Keep the makeup light. Natural's fine.

459
00:35:07,599 --> 00:35:09,480
We'll see.

460
00:36:07,480 --> 00:36:08,800
- Lin Yan Zhi.
- Here.

461
00:36:08,800 --> 00:36:10,080
- Shen Zhi Xing.
- Here.

462
00:36:10,080 --> 00:36:11,360
- Zhou Yan Li.
- Here.

463
00:36:11,360 --> 00:36:12,720
- Xu Cheng Chun.
- Here.

464
00:36:12,720 --> 00:36:14,000
- Gu Xun.
- Here.

465
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:16,320
- Ruan Si Xian.
- Here.

466
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:40,600
Ruan, I'm leaving.

467
00:36:40,600 --> 00:36:42,840
You're the only female trainee
left in this batch.

468
00:36:42,840 --> 00:36:44,600
Hang in here.

469
00:39:25,360 --> 00:39:26,920
Captain Fan, have a seat.

470
00:39:26,920 --> 00:39:28,520
Mr. Fu.

471
00:39:32,320 --> 00:39:33,960
Thank you.

472
00:39:34,640 --> 00:39:37,360
- Thank you for your hard work today.
- Not at all.

473
00:39:37,360 --> 00:39:38,719
I should be thanking you, Mr. Fu.

474
00:39:38,719 --> 00:39:41,880
I can't tell you how happy I am today.

475
00:39:41,880 --> 00:39:44,720
Maybe no one else quite gets it.

476
00:39:44,720 --> 00:39:50,520
Being here with my instructor and my student,
promoting Hengshi Air's new aircraft.

477
00:39:50,520 --> 00:39:54,080
I think I was the luckiest person
in the hangar.

478
00:39:54,840 --> 00:39:57,880
To be honest, I never expected Ruan
to come back to Hengshi Air.

479
00:39:57,880 --> 00:40:00,600
I remember when she first came to see me
in Qin Island.

480
00:40:00,600 --> 00:40:04,440
She was still pretty bitter about
the Soar Initiative being scrapped.

481
00:40:05,491 --> 00:40:10,470
As for the Soar Initiative,
I was in a tough spot back then.

482
00:40:10,470 --> 00:40:12,240
A lot of pressure.

483
00:40:12,240 --> 00:40:13,760
I understand.

484
00:40:13,760 --> 00:40:18,080
But since she came back,
I can tell she's made peace with the past.

485
00:40:18,080 --> 00:40:20,120
Actually, I asked you here today

486
00:40:20,120 --> 00:40:25,520
to get to know more about Ruan Si Xian's time
at the academy.

487
00:40:27,160 --> 00:40:30,720
Her situation was completely different from
other sponsored trainees'.

488
00:40:30,720 --> 00:40:35,000
She even sold her house to pay for the tuition.

489
00:40:35,000 --> 00:40:38,466
That's never happened before at our academy.

490
00:40:38,466 --> 00:40:40,786
She sold her house?

491
00:40:41,520 --> 00:40:43,120
I sold my house.

492
00:40:43,120 --> 00:40:45,960
Plus some help from friends,
I've got enough for tuition.

493
00:40:45,960 --> 00:40:48,280
Selling the house isn't a commitment.

494
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:50,440
Neither is raising enough money.

495
00:40:50,440 --> 00:40:53,200
It just means you can afford the tuition.

496
00:40:53,200 --> 00:40:56,560
You've got a ticket to learning, nothing more.

497
00:40:56,560 --> 00:40:58,400
That's merely a beginning.

498
00:40:58,400 --> 00:41:00,960
The real challenge is the journey ahead,

499
00:41:00,960 --> 00:41:06,960
and it's going to be way harder
and more painful than you can imagine.

500
00:41:06,960 --> 00:41:09,120
You'll break down again and again.

501
00:41:09,120 --> 00:41:12,440
And the doubt that creeps in
after each breakdown?

502
00:41:12,440 --> 00:41:14,324
That's the real killer.

503
00:41:14,324 --> 00:41:19,553
That pain will make you want to quit.

504
00:41:19,553 --> 00:41:21,673
Do you still want to do this?

505
00:41:22,486 --> 00:41:24,006
Yes.

506
00:41:29,480 --> 00:41:31,440
Good.

507
00:41:31,440 --> 00:41:32,520
Then remember this.

508
00:41:32,520 --> 00:41:37,960
From the moment you start,
that money is as good as gone.

509
00:41:37,960 --> 00:41:40,440
If you make it, you'll have your license.

510
00:41:40,440 --> 00:41:43,000
If you don't, you take the loss.

511
00:41:43,000 --> 00:41:46,440
The director also said, plenty of people
get washed out along the way.

512
00:41:46,440 --> 00:41:47,522
And on top of that,

513
00:41:47,522 --> 00:41:51,240
other students go straight
to their sponsoring airlines after graduation.

514
00:41:51,240 --> 00:41:52,440
You?

515
00:41:52,440 --> 00:41:57,480
You'll have to find an airline on your own,
with no backing.

516
00:41:58,600 --> 00:42:01,760
These are all things you're signing up for
from day one.

517
00:42:01,760 --> 00:42:03,640
Do you still want to do this?

518
00:42:04,600 --> 00:42:06,280
Yes, I do.

519
00:42:08,040 --> 00:42:13,280
At our academy, exam order is determined by
academic performance throughout the year.

520
00:42:13,280 --> 00:42:14,680
She started from the bottom,

521
00:42:14,680 --> 00:42:18,640
but she was the first to take the exam
and get her license.

522
00:42:18,640 --> 00:42:20,600
We can only imagine
what she put in to get there.

523
00:42:20,600 --> 00:42:26,600
In the end, she won it beautifully,
even though the odds were against her.

524
00:42:26,600 --> 00:42:31,920
And honestly,
whatever the company's priorities are,

525
00:42:31,920 --> 00:42:37,720
I want to thank you sincerely, Mr. Fu,
and the company, for recognizing female pilots.

526
00:42:48,480 --> 00:42:49,644
Mr. Fu,

527
00:42:51,320 --> 00:42:54,920
anything else to ask?

528
00:42:56,480 --> 00:43:03,840
I'm just grateful
we pushed to get Ruan Si Xian back.

529
00:43:18,760 --> 00:43:23,200
She even sold her house to pay for the tuition.

530
00:43:23,200 --> 00:43:24,720
She started from the bottom,

531
00:43:24,720 --> 00:43:28,160
but she was the first to take the exam
and get her license.

532
00:43:28,160 --> 00:43:31,000
We can only imagine
what she put in to get there.

533
00:43:32,240 --> 00:43:35,920
[Z101 - Let's Soar Over Mountains and Seas.]

534
00:43:35,920 --> 00:43:39,600
[A Transformation. A Bright New Future.]
